+ *   owner's decision of 11 Oct, "the middle amplifiers to exactly stock": 0xd700 -> 0xf000) is BELOW this tablet's
+ *   stock, not stock; 0x5f TDMSPKG (bits 9:5) 5; the battery safeguard's 0x5a 0x2d8e, 0x5b 0x6095, 0x5c 0x330b (the
