+ * ---- icepcie=1 (kit 23d1, CLASS C: new GDSC, branch-clock and TCSR writes) -------------------------------------------
+ * Runs inside icewifi=2 (23c2) while the WCN7860 is powered, and REFUSES unless that power-up held (gpio18 sw_ctrl = 1).
+ * PCIe0's power and clocks only - no PHY table, no PERST, no link (23d2). Values from Linux (gcc-kaanapali.c,
+ * tcsrcc-kaanapali.c, the iceland DT's pcie@1c00000 / phy@1c06000):
+ *   1. RPMh: the PHY's supplies L3I_E0 (vdda-phy, "vreg_l3i_0p8", 880 mV) and L1D_E0 (vdda-pll, "vreg_l1d_1p2",
