+ *   2. GDSCs: GCC 0x6b004 (PCIE_0_GDSC) then 0x6c000 (PCIE_0_PHY_GDSC): SW_COLLAPSE (bit 0) cleared, PWR_ON (bit 31)
+ *      waited for up to 100 ms; not on -> everything undone, refused.
+ *   3. TCSR 0x01fc0000 + 0x15044 (TCSR_PCIE_0_CLKREF_EN) bit 0 set (the PHY's reference clock).
