+ * Placeholder for bsd/dev/redwood_focaltech_fw.h (iceland fork, 2026-10-30).
+ * The real file is generated by tools/mk-focaltech-fw.py from the redwood
+ * (POCO X5 Pro 5G) touch firmware, which we do not have and must not ship.
+ * The redwood touch driver is unused on the BCM2837 (QEMU) and iceland
+ * builds; this stub only keeps the standard file list compiling.
+ */
