+/*
+ * Deviation D17: the two globals that macos-owner-root-authenticated-open's hook reads
+ * (vfs_syscalls.c, compiled on the macOS target whatever the owner flags are) are defined
+ * unconditionally, at these values, so the flags-off chain links. With XNU_OWNER_ROOT_AUDIT off
