+	 * w9-aks (the ci-headers route, the same shape): ci-headers/ members stage the runtime-compile headers
+	 * the plugin's source-compile include path names (-I/private/var/ngpu/ci-headers, the frameworks patch:
+	 * CIKernelMetalLibPrivate.h, whose text exists only inside CoreImage's binary in the dyld shared cache)
+	 * at /private/var/ngpu/ci-headers. Only with icewl_hdr=1: off, the members are skipped like firmware/
