+		/* macOS: GPUBundles/ files go to the Data volume's /Library/GPUBundles, where IOGPU looks for <MetalPluginName>.bundle,
+		 * protected as kmutil installs them (native_gpu_bundle_protect); Library/ files to the same volume's /Library (the audio
