+ * /private/var/db/com.apple.xpc.launchd/disabled.plist on Data is merged, never replaced: an existing XML file keeps every key,
+ * a key of ours set to <false/> becomes <true/>, a missing one is added before the last </dict>; a binary, oversized or
+ * unreadable file is left alone. The empty disabled.migrated marker beside it is made if missing (it selects launchd's modern
+ * override loader). After lenzhang/UniXNU-sheng 6880068 package/BootWatchdogPolicy.c:119-170 (BSD-2-Clause-Patent; the
+ * method, written here). Runs after the Data mount and the firmlinks, before launchd. exec_deny stays the safety net. Lines
+ * "owner Data: launchd-disable: ...". Never fatal.
