+ * (UniXNU-sheng@2061710 package/BootWatchdogPolicy.c, MIT, its lite=1 set): photoanalysisd and mediaanalysisd are
+ * login-time image analysis (memory and CPU at exactly the session-collapse moment the pairing ladder mapped, and our own
