+ * install6.1 (E3): two more, the crash-report amplifier and the diagnostics host, from the 19 Nov live read of the
+ * installed line (the jetsam backlog the owner's manual boot sat in). com.apple.ReportCrashService is the XPC service of
+ * the OS image's own OSAnalytics.framework/Versions/A/XPCServices/ReportCrashService.xpc (the firmlinked
+ * CoreServices/XPCServices copy; the bundle's CFBundleIdentifier and launchd's own com.apple.ReportCrashService.sb
+ * profile name the label, and the live shell read two instances at 456 + 452 MB RSS with 96 % CPU each): ~900 MB of
