+ * one this merge can reach, because diagnostics_agent and diagnosticextensionsd are Aqua LaunchAgents whose per-uid
+ * override database this system-domain merge never touches. The .ips writers themselves (com.apple.ReportCrash.Root,
+ * the system copy of the crash reporter, and its on-demand service) are left enabled: diagnostic boots keep the
