+ * equals our fbrotate=270 copy), instead of the processors' copy; the presenter waits for its fence at most gpurot_ms
+ * (default 20) ms. Not done in time: this frame is copied by the CPU as before (no GPU blit while that one is in flight);
+ * three such frames in a row: gpurot off for the rest of the boot. fb_scanwc / fb_early / fb_pri / fb_rottile stay as they
+ * are for the copies. NEW KIND OF WRITE: the GPU writes the panel's memory (the display scans it) through a new GPU SMMU
+ * mapping of that range (read-write, its exact size). Lines "icegpurot:" (every 5 s: blits, fallbacks, GPU time, waits).
+ */
