+ * GPU work on it was still going on), UNWRITTEN (the panel still holds what it held before the blit: the blit did not
+ * cover it) or WRONG (the blit wrote something else: it read the source's memory while the processor's cache held a
+ * newer line, or the pixel landed elsewhere). The mismatching grid cells are joined into rectangles (upright and panel
+ * coordinates). Lines "icehk3:". Boot-arg gpurot_clean=1 (31hk3f candidate, not in 31hk3): each blit's source rows
