+ * splitmix64's finalizer chained over the block's ten words, and the same over the six words the
+ * loader prints (IA, IB, GA), so a run's loader log can be checked against it; the block's popcount
+ * and non-zero words; whether the ten key registers read back as the block; and a 32-bit fold of
+ * the five signatures (IA, IB, DA, DB, GA) of one fixed value under one fixed modifier that no
+ * kernel pointer uses: the keys this core really signs with, the same on every core.
